<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 9,260 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 2,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  131   (180 and 162)</p>
<p>    Good		122   (122 and 150)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     114   (115 and 125)</p>
<p>    Medium	    103   (107 and 104)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 90   ( 90 and  90)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 131 pence for a Kenya PD.</p>
</text>
